EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for expressing interest in Arizona State University. I am happy to hear you are ready to show your Sun Devil spirit.

As an ASU student, you’ll receive a free gold ASU T-shirt when you attend New Student Orientation (https://eoss.asu.edu/orientation) and again during Fall Welcome (https://eoss.asu.edu/fallwelcome) as an ASU student!

Until then, you can visit the official ASU Bookstore at http://sundevilbookstores.com for T-shirts, apparel, books accessories, collectibles, supplies, technology and gifts for the whole family.

Please let me know if you have any additional questions about ASU or the admission process.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
